# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values.
# `.env.local` is ignored by git, so secrets never end up in the public repo.
#
# Phase 1 needs no environment variables: all data is stored in the browser.
#
# Phase 5 (Supabase) – public values, safe in the browser:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
#
# Phase 6 (AI) – the Anthropic API key is NEVER set here. It lives only as a
# secret in a Supabase Edge Function, so it never reaches the frontend.
